v 3
d 'DOPACK': collect every user-written file needed to run a do-file or an ado-command
d
d dopack reads a main do-file (or an ado-file) statically, without running it,
d and follows the code that would run: do-files called with do, run and include,
d user-written commands and their help and companion files, and changes of the
d working directory and the ado-path. All files that are not part of the Stata
d installation are copied to an empty folder, together with a readme.md that
d describes the purpose of the code and how to run it.
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d KW: reproducibility
d KW: replication package
d KW: do-file
d KW: ado-file
d KW: dependencies
d
d Author: Barna Szabo, Karolinska Institutet
d Support: https://github.com/szabobarnaKI/dopack
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261126
d
f dopack.ado
f dopack.sthlp
